      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d prefer doing this here so we can fail early.\nIf I were to call `FileInputStream.getFD()` in `run()`, then it would be difficult to surface the IOException, as the exception would happen in another thread.\nThis thread dying or failing to call `mConsoleOutput.getFD()` also means the VM console out pipe would eventually build up and softlock the guest system... so I\u0027d want to detect / handle this before run() is called.",
