      "lineNbr": 142,
      "author": {
        "id": 1337669
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-22T13:45:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e wouldn\u0027t it be better try again next time?\n\nyes? but how would I tell if it is a transient one? I think we only consider EINTR as transient, but I think JVM doesn\u0027t pass through EINTR, so is there any case when transient write error could happen?",
      "parentUuid": "7a0d447b_7eb57a43",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 142,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 142,
        "endChar": 44
      },
