      },
      "lineNbr": 142,
      "author": {
        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-23T05:49:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t have a specific scenario, but giving up on any error just doesn\u0027t look good to me.",
      "parentUuid": "d10633ca_f87a8401",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 142,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 142,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "f5f05677258ecb118e6fa5c6837ec1000d12665b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6484a263_a1ce5f2e",
        "filename": "java/framework/src/android/system/virtualmachine/ConsoleForwarder.java",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 142,
      "author": {
        "id": 1337669
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-23T06:37:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "what I\u0027m more worried is that it might be dangerous to retry unless we know it\u0027s safe to do so (such as EINTR).\nFor example if we get a EBADF, then it might mean the underlying fd is closed/broken whatever. If we still keep retry writing to the FD, then we might be writing to a dangling file descriptor, or worse, be writing to other unrelated open file that happens to be allocated to the FD we are writing to.",
      "parentUuid": "5c1cf633_3b762aa0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 142,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 142,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "f5f05677258ecb118e6fa5c6837ec1000d12665b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2108e5ef_8c2f2956",
        "filename": "java/framework/src/android/system/virtualmachine/ConsoleForwarder.java",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 142,
      "author": {
        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-23T07:10:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok. I was thinking about things like EAGAIN, EIO, or ENOSPC.\n\nEBADF for sure is a good reason to not try again.",
      "parentUuid": "6484a263_a1ce5f2e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 142,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 142,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "f5f05677258ecb118e6fa5c6837ec1000d12665b",
